    "featuredQuote": "聽宿鳥未驚，鄰雞先覺",
    "source": "chinese-poetry · 宋詞三百首",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json",
